  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Cristina Junqueira (born September 1982) is a Brazilian businesswoman who is the co-founder of Nubank.\nJunqueira has been a strong advocate for gender inclusion in the workplace. As cofounder of Nubank, she has led the company's policy on inclusivity programs and fought to increase female representation in both tech and finance. Junqueira is currently the CEO of the company's emerging operations in the United States\n\n",
    "sourceId": "wikipedia-en",
    "usage": "Research excerpt; paraphrase and cross-check before publication."
